{"title":"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 13","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The sum of the first 100 positive integers (that is, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/c/66c2208cf5327385507e53c1d3e49df71ed0ffc3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 + 2 + 3 + \\cdots + 99 + 100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"207\" height=\"15\" />) equals 5050. The sum of the first 100 positive multiples of 10 (that is, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/0/990a15ae3ed3f1465e04a9327c17453ef03fa82d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10 + 20 + 30 + \\cdots + 990 + 1000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"252\" height=\"15\" />) equals\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/b/05be3ed8b78b551231a0176aedb71a9ef0696e23.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 10~100 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 5950 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 50~500 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 6050 \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 45~450$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"531\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Because each term is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> times larger, the sum must also be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> times larger. this means that the sum is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/7/bd719a2ff7701491b162284b517fd4937403e362.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5050 \\times 10 = \\boxed{\\textbf {(C) } 50~500}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"200\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher \n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)\">2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 12\">Problem 12</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 14\">Problem 14</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2017 CEMC Ga